OL,3,GNEWSATwo deny murdering eight-week-old
OL,4,Ababy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and woman have denied murdering
OL,7,Fan eight-week-old baby.
OL,9,FLincolnshire Police said the baby died
OL,10,Fin hospital after officers were called
OL,11,Fto an address in Bourne, Lincolnshire,
OL,12,Fon 31 October 2023.
OL,14,FLiam Neve, 26, of Spinney Close,
OL,15,FGrimoldby, Louth, and Lauren
OL,16,FMurgatroyd, 26, of Novak Place,
OL,17,FMorecambe, Lancashire, were charged in
OL,18,FJune with the murder of a child aged
OL,19,Funder one.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
