OL,3,GNEWSATwo deny murdering eight-week-old
OL,4,Ababy
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeve and Murgatroyd both pleaded not
OL,7,Fguilty to murdering the infant, who
OL,8,Fcannot be named for legal reasons, at
OL,9,FLincoln Crown Court earlier.
